{"word":"μαλακίζω","uri":"malakizô","senses":[{"word":"μαλακίζω","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">μαλακίζω</span></span> [<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ᾰᾰ</span>] rendre mou, amollir, <span class=\"ital\">d’où au pass.</span>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> être <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> devenir faible, languissant, <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">H.A.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 26 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Th.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Char.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 2 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Luc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Lex.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> <span class=\"ital\">au\nmor.</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> être mou, agir\nmollement, <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">120,\n7 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Luc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Herm.</span> <span class=\"refch\">24</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> être amolli, énervé,\n<span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 42,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 3, 3,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> être amolli, se laisser\namollir <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> fléchir, <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">6, 29 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">πρός τι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 40,</span> en présence de qqe ch. ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Moy.</span> (<span class=\"ital\">ao.</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἐμαλακισάμην</span>) être\nfaible, faiblir : <span class=\"grec\">πρὸς τὸν θάνατον,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ap.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">33,</span>